":"鼓励肯定","text":"你很重要。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0358","category":"鼓励肯定","text":"今天也要给自己鼓掌。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0359","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不想答应就拒绝。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0360","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"先问清楚再决定。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0361","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不舒服就说出来。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0362","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不用勉强自己陪笑。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0363","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"需要帮忙就开口。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0364","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"这件事你可以慢点回复。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0365","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"别让别人的情绪压住你。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0366","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"你可以先照顾自己的感受。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0367","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不想解释也可以不解释。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0368","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"有边界不是自私。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0369","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"我跟你说，不想就说不。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0370","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"累了就说累。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0371","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不用什么都自己扛。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0372","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"需要小苏听你说吗？","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0373","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"你可以先拒绝。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0374","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不舒服的关系就远一点。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0375","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"别委屈自己。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0376","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"有话就好好说。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0377","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"求助不是麻烦。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0378","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"你可以把自己放前面。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0379","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"不想去就不去。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0380","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"今天先照顾自己。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0381","category":"边界沟通求助","text":"你可以说不的。","source":"builtin"},{"id":"builtin-0382","category":"边界沟通求助","tex